  "changelog": "**Version 1.0.2 introduces a new parsing backend and multi-layered financial post-processing for PDF finance documents.**\n\n- Added 10 new scripts for 6-layer financial post-processing, covering HTML table parsing, multi-level header detection, cross-page table merging, numeric normalization, finance term alignment, and rule-based business validation.\n- Switched backend to use Volcano LAS las_pdf_parse_doubao for primary PDF parsing with TOS upload integration.\n- Enhanced output with schema-compliant financial JSON (including value, unit, source_page, and validation fields).\n- Updated environment requirements: now requires LAS_API_KEY and TOS credentials.\n- Workflow, output structure, and troubleshooting documentation revised to support the new engine and processing pipeline.",
